<title>USA: Conmed sets $30 mln stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Conmed sets $30 mln stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>UTICA, N.Y. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONMED Corp said Tuesday its board authorized the buy-back of up to $30 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The medical products manufacturer said it will finance the purchases from cash-on-hand and amounts available under its bank credit facility.</p>
<p>At the end of the first quarter, the company had about 15.2 million shares outstanding.</p>
